    5    3412    1    3488    514    0    0    Colusa_Weir        / Bypass 5 - Colusa Weir spill to Butte Basin
    6    3552    1    3881    515    0    0    Tisdale_Weir        / Bypass 6 - Tisdale Weir near Grimes
    7    4143    1    4344    516    0    0    Fremont_Weir        / Bypass 7 - Fremont Weir spill to Yolo Bypass    
    8    4169    1    4452    517    0    0    Sac_Weir        / Bypass 8 - Sacramento Weir spill to Yolo Bypass
    9    3833    1    4441    518    0    0    KLR_to_Yolo_Bypass    / Bypass 9 - Knights Landing Ridge Cut flood flow to Yolo Bypass
C - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -                                                     
